      "id": "claim_a1bcb4b744964bf488d01146010946de",
      "statement": "Each MCP request gets a unique requestId of form mcp-<timestamp>-<random> from createRequestId, embedded in the envelope and validated by parseEnvelope; the relay stores the MCP socket under pendingRequestKey(scopeKey, message.id) and the controller echoes the incoming message.id into the response so routeExtensionResponse can match and forward it back.",
