    {
      "id": "claim_c8341ab383814fb89038344a7c5b7ce3",
      "statement": "The MCP request timeout is configured by BRIJIO_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS (legacy BROWSERBRIDGE_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS alias), parsed by parseTimeoutMs in page-context.ts with a 5000ms default, flowing into every request config; requestBrijio starts a setTimeout that resolves with timeoutResponse when no reply arrives, and approval-gated tools use approvalTimeoutMs ?? timeoutMs so user approval wait is not charged against the normal budget.",
      "evidence": [
