    {
      "id": "claim_87554db770f94c5ca8a47857e03965e2",
      "statement": "submit_form, fetch_resource, and download_file are approval-gated: the MCP websocket-client attaches approval metadata (actionUUID and approvalRequest: true), and the shared controller's ensureApprovedAction consults an ApprovalAdapter, checks per-session grants keyed by origin and actionType, and otherwise shows an in-tab approval banner, resolving to approval_denied, approval_timeout, or approval_origin_changed errors that propagate back to the agent; in perform_batch an approval timeout aborts and skips remaining actions.",
