    {
      "id": "claim_c0cdd03ce46e4b5f97f003436a80964d",
      "statement": "Per ADR 0061 the MCP server forwards original error codes instead of flattening them: parseRouterErrorEnvelope forwards any string router code (e.g. invalid_message, invalid_json, browser_unavailable, ambiguous_browser_target) rather than returning invalidResponse for unrecognized codes, and parseErrorPayload preserves stale_context and page_navigated with detail while forwarding other extension codes (e.g. not_supported, cors_blocked, http_error, size_exceeded) instead of wrapping as browser_error.",
      "evidence": [
        {
